# Static marketing site — no SPA routing.
# Do NOT add a catch-all rewrite (e.g. /* /index.html 200): it turns every
# unknown URL into a soft-404 (homepage served with HTTP 200) and can shadow
# static assets. With no rules here, Cloudflare Pages serves index.html at /,
# serves /sitemap.xml, /robots.txt, /og-image.png, /favicon.png directly with
# their correct content types, and returns a real 404 for unknown paths.
